    affiliation: "National University of Singapore"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Narrrcis/agent-governance-layer"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic capability layer that sits between an autonomous agent and a
  market venue. It turns observable reliability and risk signals into governance
  states, maps those states to explicit capability envelopes, gates every order
  before execution, and reconciles what actually executed against what was
  authorized. Extracted from an AML-Sim multi-agent market research platform.
keywords:
  - agent safety
  - guardrails
  - LLM agents
  - risk controls
  - multi-agent systems
  - market simulation
